WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.127
(Machine click)

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:05.839
♪♪

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:08.091
William:
I don’t know if this will get to
you, I hope so.

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:10.010
♪♪

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:13.013
William:
I can’t go back in time and fix
all of the mistakes that I made.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.264
♪♪

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:16.683
William:
But maybe I can leave something
for the future.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:19.853
(Eerie sound)

00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:22.397
A legacy.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:25.692
♪♪

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.778
Lee:
The world is on fire.

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:30.072
I decided to do something about
it.

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:33.450
♪♪

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:36.787
Lee:
Hopes. Dreams. Ambitions.

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:38.872
Lee:
The mission was to protect their
world...

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.123
Lee:
The mission was to protect their
world... (Monster hissing)

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:41.333
Lee:
...and ours.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.795
♪♪

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:46.213
Lee:
It’s what we wanted Monarch to
be.

00:00:46.213 --> 00:00:48.257
♪♪

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:49.591
Lee:
Instead of chasing monsters.

00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:51.718
(Water cascading)

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:54.471
If you come with me, you’ll know
everything, I promise.

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:55.847
(Large inpact)
(Growling)

00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:56.640
(Shrieking)

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.059
♪♪

00:00:59.059 --> 00:00:59.851
(Jet engines)

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:01.520
(Growling and crash sounds)

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:04.481
(People screaming)

00:01:04.481 --> 00:01:05.732
(Explosion)
(Roaring)

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:08.402
(Intense music)
(Roaring)

